        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2G20-2214] The message \"AuthorizationRes\" shall contain the ResponseCode \"WARNING_CertificateRevoked\" if the SECC (or SA) deduces (using OCSP responses or CRL) that one (or more) of the certificates in the ContractCertificate chain is received in AuthorizationReq message, in attribute ContractSignatureCertChain, is revoked. This includes any cross certificates (if applicable).",
            "block_bbox": [
                166,
                243,
                1113,
                375
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
