        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2217] The message AuthorizationRes shall contain the ResponseCode \"WARNING_GeneralPnCAuthorizationError\" when the SECC received the information (potentially from SA; t is not in the scope of this document to define how the SECC received this information) that there is an issue either with the contract associated with the ContractCertificate message or with the ContractCertificate it received in AuthorizationReq message and conditions are not met to apply any of the response codes as defined by [V2G20-2209], [V2G20-2210], [V2G20-2211], [V2G20-2212], [V2G20-2213], [V2G20-2214], [V2G20-2215] and [V2G20-2216].",
